    "body": "@domenic thanks for your feedback. The native input fields in my example have `type` checkbox. Why does the `document.forms[0].elements['checkboxes']` return a list of radios in the first place and not a list of node elements including the custom ones?\r\n\r\nI'll (also) report it as a potential Chromium bug.",
