    "created_at": "2020-09-03T16:54:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-03T16:54:51Z",
    "body": "It looks like per spec it's supposed to return a list of all listed elements, including custom elements. I wish we had excluded it though. Legacy features like RadioNodeList should be quarantined and not allowed to interact with new features like custom elements. Oh well.\r\n\r\nI'll close this since the spec works in the manner you prefer.",
